data_prompt.content:
Task: Sequential Recommendation

User ID: {user_id}
User profile:
{user_profile}
Historical interactions:
{history}
Candidate item attributes:
{candidate_item_attributes}

Return valid JSON only in this format:
{{"ranked_items": [item_id1, item_id2, ...], "reasoning": "brief explanation"}}

Requirements:
- Include every candidate item ID exactly once in ranked_items.
- Do not include IDs outside the candidate list.
- Keep reasoning brief.
